    "body": "# PR type\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] New Feature\n- [ ] Document Updates\n- [x] More Models or Datasets Support\n\n# PR information\n\n## What\nAdd SFT support for MiniCPM-V-4.7-1B and MiniCPM-V-4.7-35B-A3B with `transformers>=5.18.0`.\n\n## Changes\n- Reuse the 4.6 loader/template and register both 4.7 models.\n- Adapt Canvas M-RoPE, mixed image/video inputs, and MoE/ZeRO-3 training.\n- Keep packing/padding-free disabled.\n\n## Validation\nBoth models passed 8-GPU SFT smoke tests in 4x/16x mode (2 optimizer steps per run), checkpoint reload/generation, native parity checks, and lint.\n",
